{"id":"A1-L042","title":"Key verb: go","cefr":"A1","level":"A1","unit":"A1-U03","focus":"Verbo-chave: go","targets":{"grammar":"Verbo-chave: go","pron":"I am × I’m","verbs":[],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["special","shopping","destination","journey","tour","luggage","suitcase","flight","departure","arrival","souvenir","itinerary","visa","currency"],"field":"Alimentação","genre":"Conto e trecho de peça","skill":"Escuta","words_min":14},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 42 · Key verb: go","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Verbo-chave: go.","**Pronúncia:** I am × I’m.","**14 palavras novas** (alimentação).","**Texto do dia:** conto e trecho de peça."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A1):** eu consigo usar go com lugares e atividades e ler um conto."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você ainda não faz as provas, mas já treina o formato de tarefas curtas que elas usam.","Esta aula treina **ouvir e anotar informações (IELTS Listening, TOEFL Listening)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["special","especial"],["shopping","compras"],["destination","destination"],["journey","journey"],["tour","tour"],["luggage","luggage"],["suitcase","suitcase"],["flight","flight"],["departure","departure"],["arrival","arrival"],["souvenir","souvenir"],["itinerary","itinerary"],["visa","visa"],["currency","currency"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A short story","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"The Night Market","paras":["Every Friday, Mia **goes** to the night market. She **goes** with her friends by bus. They **go** shopping and **go** for a walk by the river.","Tonight is special. Mia **goes** home early because it is her mother’s birthday. She **goes** to bed happy."],"kicker":"SHORT STORY","by":"A reader","gloss":[["market","mercado"],["river","rio"],["birthday","aniversário"],["special","especial"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Mia goes to the market on Friday.","ans":"T","why":"“Every Friday.”"},{"q":"Mia goes by taxi.","ans":"F","why":"Ônibus."},{"q":"Tonight is a birthday.","ans":"T","why":"mother’s birthday."},{"q":"Mia lives near the river.","ans":"NG","why":"Não diz."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“go shopping” means…","opts":["fazer compras","ir ao shopping","comprar um shopping"],"ans":0,"why":"go shopping = fazer compras."},{"q":"“river” means…","opts":["rio","mar","lago"],"ans":0,"why":"river = rio."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Key verb: go","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Uso","Exemplo"],"rows":[["ir a um lugar","**I go to school.**"],["go + -ing","**go shopping / swimming / running**"],["go by + transporte","**go by bus / car / train**"],["go home / go to bed","**I go home. She goes to bed.**"],["go + adj","**go bad / go wrong**"]],"cap":"Go: usos"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Sem “to”","body":"Não use **to** com *home*: *go home* (não *go to home*)."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"Mia ___ to the market. (go)","a":"goes","why":"Mia → goes.","say":"Mia goes to the market"},{"s":"They ___ shopping. (go)","a":"go","why":"they → go."},{"s":"I go ___ bus. (by)","a":"by","why":"go by bus."},{"s":"She goes ___ bed early. (to)","a":"to","why":"go to bed."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["river","rio"],["birthday","aniversário"],["special","especial"],["shopping","compras"],["walk","caminhada"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["go","How","do","you"],"ans":"How do you go","pt":"Como você vai?"},{"words":["do","you","go","home","When"],"ans":"When do you go home","pt":"Quando vai para casa?"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"special","pos":"adj","pt":"especial","ex":"A special day.","expt":"Um dia especial."},{"w":"shopping","pos":"noun","pt":"compras","ex":"Go shopping.","expt":"Fazer compras."},{"w":"destination","pos":"word","pt":"destination","ex":"destino","expt":"A popular destination."},{"w":"journey","pos":"word","pt":"journey","ex":"jornada","expt":"A long journey."},{"w":"tour","pos":"word","pt":"tour","ex":"passeio guiado","expt":"A city tour."},{"w":"luggage","pos":"word","pt":"luggage","ex":"bagagem","expt":"Light luggage."},{"w":"suitcase","pos":"word","pt":"suitcase","ex":"mala","expt":"A big suitcase."},{"w":"flight","pos":"word","pt":"flight","ex":"voo","expt":"A night flight."},{"w":"departure","pos":"word","pt":"departure","ex":"partida","expt":"Departure at nine."},{"w":"arrival","pos":"word","pt":"arrival","ex":"chegada","expt":"Late arrival."},{"w":"souvenir","pos":"word","pt":"souvenir","ex":"lembrança","expt":"Buy a souvenir."},{"w":"itinerary","pos":"word","pt":"itinerary","ex":"roteiro","expt":"A busy itinerary."},{"w":"visa","pos":"word","pt":"visa","ex":"visto","expt":"Apply for a visa."},{"w":"currency","pos":"word","pt":"currency","ex":"moeda","expt":"Local currency."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**Where do you go on Friday?** — Aonde você vai na sexta?","**I go to the night market.** — Vou ao mercado noturno.","**How do you go?** — Como você vai?","**Where do you go?** — Aonde você vai?","**Have a nice trip!** — Boa viagem!","**I’m going to…** — Eu vou para…","**Let’s go!** — Vamos!"]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"go","pt":"ir","forms":[["I go","I go to school."],["you go","You go home."],["he / she / it goes","She goes shopping."],["we / they go","We go by bus."]],"note":"Verbo-chave: ir. go to the park, go home, go shopping."}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"Night market","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"Night market","lines":[["Ana","Where do you go on Friday?","Aonde você vai na sexta?"],["Mia","I go to the night market.","Vou ao mercado noturno."],["Ana","How do you go?","Como você vai?"],["Mia","By bus.","De ônibus."],["Ana","When do you go home?","Quando vai para casa?"],["Mia","Early. Tonight is a birthday.","Cedo. Hoje é aniversário."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: I am × I’m","items":[{"label":"I am × I’m","note":"Sílaba tônica em MARket, RIVer, BIRTHday.","words":["market","river","birthday","special"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Say where you go every week.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I go to the market on Friday."},{"q":"Say how you go.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I go by bus."},{"q":"Ask: Where do you go?","pt":"Pergunte.","model":"Where do you go?"}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 5 sentences with go in different uses.","model":"I go to school. I go shopping on Saturday. I go by bus. I go home at six. I go to bed at ten.","checklist":["Usei **go 3 vezes**","Usei **go + -ing**","Usei **go by**"],"words":"5 frases"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “river” mean?","opts":["aniversário","compras","rio"],"ans":2,"why":"**river** = rio."},{"q":"What does “birthday” mean?","opts":["aniversário","especial","caminhada"],"ans":0,"why":"**birthday** = aniversário."},{"q":"What does “special” mean?","opts":["compras","especial","para casa"],"ans":1,"why":"**special** = especial."},{"q":"What does “shopping” mean?","opts":["caminhada","cedo","compras"],"ans":2,"why":"**shopping** = compras."},{"q":"“go home” (sem to)","opts":["go home","go to home","go in home"],"ans":0,"why":"home não leva to."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Em **Speaking Part 1**, perguntas sobre lugares usam *go*.","Em **Reading**, contos mostram sequência no tempo."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Faça um **mapa da cidade** e peça *Where do you go?*","Cartões de colocações com go.","Erro típico: *“go to home.”* → *go home.*"]}]}]}